:INFO
Art. 42 Repeal of other legislation
The DETEC Ordinance of 24 November 1994 on Special Category Aircraft is repealed.
|

:NOTE
[AS 1994 3076; 2009 5399; 2011 1155 No I 8; 2014 2315; 2015 1643 Annex 2, 2193; 2016 2999; 2017 5067 No III; 2018 3847 No II]
|

:INFO
Art. 43 Transitional provisions to the amendment of 24 November 2022
1 Operational authorisations which were granted before the commencement of the amendment of 24 November 2022 based on the previous Article 17 in conjunction with Article 18 paragraph 1 letter b OSCA apply until their validity expires, but until 1 September 2023 at the latest.
2 Unmanned aircraft in accordance with Section 3 may be operated under previous legislation until 1 September 2023 at the latest.
|

:INFO
Art. 44 Commencement
This Ordinance comes into force on 1 January 2023.

